# Cross-origin isolation: lets onnxruntime-web's threaded wasm backend use
# SharedArrayBuffer (multi-threaded inference) in the OCR and translate
# workers. Every cross-origin subresource must opt in — all bundled assets
# are same-origin, and the runtime model/wasm fetches (Hugging Face, jsDelivr)
# send CORS headers.
#
# Referrer policy: Hugging Face's resolver rejects (404, no CORS headers) any
# request whose Referer is a *.workers.dev URL, so model fetches from the
# deployed site would always fail. "same-origin" drops the Referer on
# cross-origin fetches while keeping it for same-origin ones. Applies to the
# worker scripts too — the OCR/translate workers inherit their policy from
# the response that served them.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Referrer-Policy: same-origin
